  you shall not see (lo tireh): Torah 3 ['Deut 22:1', 'Deut 22:4', 'Num 23:13'] | Bible 6 ['2Sam 3:13', 'Deut 22:1', 'Deut 22:4', 'Isa 33:19', 'Job 22:11', 'Num 23:13']
